{
  "title": "Elastic IP · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "리소스를 바꿔도 유지할 수 있는 고정 퍼블릭 IPv4 주소입니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Elastic IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#guide-1\">할당과 연결</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#guide-2\">고정 주소가 필요한지 판단하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>21 / 62</span></div><h1>Elastic IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span></h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Elastic IP는 <strong>AWS 계정에 할당받아 사용하는 고정 퍼블릭 IPv4 주소</strong>입니다. EC2 인스턴스나 네트워크 인터페이스에 연결해 외부에서 접근할 주소를 유지할 수 있습니다.</p><p>서버를 교체해도 같은 주소를 새 대상에 연결할 수 있어, 상대방이 고정 IP를 허용 목록에 등록해야 하는 환경에 유용합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"allocation-and-association\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"reassociation\"></span><h2>할당과 연결</h2><p>먼저 주소를 계정에 할당받고 원하는 리소스에 연결합니다. 주소 할당과 서버 생성은 별개이므로, 서버를 종료할 때 주소를 계속 보관할지 함께 결정합니다.</p><p>다른 대상에 재연결하면 같은 퍼블릭 주소로 접속할 수 있지만 기존 연결이 그대로 이전되는 것은 아닙니다. 대상 리소스의 리전과 네트워크 경계 그룹<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 제약도 확인합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"regional-scope-and-network-border-group\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"public-ipv4-pricing\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"elastic-ip-and-other-entry-points\"></span><h2>고정 주소가 필요한지 판단하기</h2><p>일반적인 웹 서비스는 도메인을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/\">로드 밸런서</a>나 CloudFront에 연결해 운영할 수 있습니다. 여러 서버로 부하를 나누려는 목적이라면 고정 IP 하나보다 서비스 진입점 구성이 중요합니다.</p><p>퍼블릭 IPv4 주소에는 요금이 발생하므로 사용하지 않는 주소는 해제합니다. 외부 API가 출발지 IP를 제한한다면 퍼블릭 NAT Gateway의 주소를 고정하는 구성을 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>고정 주소의 사용 순서</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>주소 할당</strong><span>계정에서 주소 확보</span></li><li><strong>대상에 연결</strong><span>서버 또는 인터페이스</span></li><li><strong>필요 시 재연결</strong><span>주소는 유지·대상 교체</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">고정되는 것은 퍼블릭 주소이며 애플리케이션의 상태나 연결까지 이전되지는 않습니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>협력사 API에 접근할 서버가 바뀌어도 허용된 출발지 IP를 유지해야 합니다. NAT Gateway에 연결한 Elastic IP를 협력사의 허용 목록에 등록합니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>네트워크 경계 그룹</strong> — AWS가 퍼블릭 IP를 외부에 알리는 네트워크 위치의 묶음입니다. 리전과 Local Zone 등의 위치에 따라 사용할 수 있는 주소 범위가 달라질 수 있습니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/elastic-ip-addresses-eip.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Elastic IP addresses ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q009\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q009\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q016\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q016\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q016</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q016/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance must retain the same public IPv4 address after it restarts. Which resource should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 Access Point</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A change to the ENI MAC address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q016\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS PrivateLink</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">EIP</a>는 계정에 할당하는 고정 공인 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 주소다. 비용과 장애 조치 설계는 별개다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q010\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q010\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q010</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs outbound IPv4 access to an internet package repository. What is a typical design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway in a public subnet and a route from the private subnet to it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach an internet gateway directly to the private subnet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy only CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q010\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a Route 53 failover policy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 퍼블릭 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>를 통해 외부 연결을 시작하고 응답받는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"2\" data-question=\"Q017\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q017\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q017</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q017/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A private EC2 instance needs access to S3 without routing S3 traffic through a NAT gateway. What is usually the simplest choice?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A public Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q017\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An Application Load Balancer</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">라우트 테이블</a>을 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>로 사설 경로를 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0,3\" data-question=\"Q083\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q083\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q083</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q083/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs to access only S3. Which TWO components reduce NAT usage and internet exposure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Configure the subnet's route table</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign an Elastic IP address to the EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Require a default route to an internet gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Create an S3 gateway VPC endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q083\" type=\"checkbox\" value=\"4\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">Allow inbound access from 0.0.0.0/0</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, D</strong> · 게이트웨이 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>와 적절한 라우트 연결을 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 접근에 공인 주소나 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>가 필수는 아니다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">이전 용어 <b>EFS</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cache/\">다음 용어 <b>ElastiCache</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
